WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
I also brought the ancestral wine that I promised.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,520
My mother is afraid that I will forget

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,280
Really brought it

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,840
The tiger's side belongs to the tiger people

5
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,640
In fact, it is soaked in beef edge.

6
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,560
There are also medicinal materials in it

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:18,330
This kind of thing is rare

8
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,640
Keep it useful

9
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,800
I also left a supply for you.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,260
It's common sense to keep the last batch of sausages.

11
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,980
When can we resume production in the future?

12
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:28,940
Don't know yet

13
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,860
Okay, I'm not welcome

14
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,300
Come back if you have the chance in the future

15
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,580
Eat directly at home

16
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:34,940
Pick whatever you want

17
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,380
Young people want to leave

18
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:39,060
It's right to seek a way out.

19
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,420
My old bones

20
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,500
Steam until it’s time to leave

21
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,980
Just let the young people go and take a look.

22
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,380
Say this again

23
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,260
Take me far away

24
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,660
Riskier

25
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,300
I protect my hometown

26
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,860
Pretty good too

27
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:55,700
Are there any supplies left?

28
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,980
Is it possible to replace the tank with meat without repairing the water tower?
